=A6they reflect the views of highly educated adults in China, very likely c=
oncentrated in the coastal provinces =E2=80=94 not the general Chinese publ=
ic</em><span>.=E2=80=9D</span></p></li><li style=3D"margin:8px 0 0 32px"><p=
 style=3D"color:rgb(54,55,55);line-height:26px;margin-bottom:0;box-sizing:b=
order-box;padding-left:4px;font-size:16px;margin:0"><span>As evidence of th=
is AI optimism gap, the index cites Ipsos online surveys, but note what the=
