5,55);text-decoration:underline" target=3D"_blank">methodology section</a><=
/strong><span>: =E2=80=9C</span><em>Samples in Brazil, Chile, China=E2=80=
=A6 are more urban, more educated, and/or more affluent than the general po=
pulation. The survey results for these countries should be viewed as reflec=
ting the views of the more =E2=80=9Cconnected=E2=80=9D segment of their pop=
ulation</em><span>.=E2=80=9D These are not apples-to-apples comparisons.</s=
pan></p></li></ul><p style=3D"margin:0 0 20px 0;color:rgb(54,55,55);line-he=
ight:26px;font-size:16px"><strong>Third, the GitHub indicators cited in the=
